  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款由 Serilum 開發的模組。用心打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於這個模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>「雞蛋孵化（Despawning Eggs Hatch）」是一款輕量且可自訂的模組，允許地上的雞蛋在即將消失前孵化。為防止無限生成雞群，預設將新生物生成數量限制為 50 隻。物品（包含雞蛋）會在 6000 tick（5 分鐘）後消失。預設情況下，雞蛋必須落在乾草塊上才會在消失時孵化。這可避免已載入區塊中的野生雞群過度繁殖。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"自訂選項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>eggOnlyHatchesWhenOnTopOfHayBlock</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，雞蛋僅在放置於乾草塊上方時才會孵化。此功能可防止野生雞群在您不知情的情況下擴散。<br><br><span><strong>eggWillHatchChance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>若實體限制器未啟動，雞蛋在消失前孵化的機率。<br><br><span><strong>onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 50，最小值 0，最大值 1000<br>防止過多實體孵化。若雞蛋周圍半徑為 'radiusEntityLimiterCheck' 格內的雞數量低於此設定值，雞蛋才會孵化。<br><br><span><strong>radiusEntityLimiterCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 32，最小值 1，最大值 256<br>用於 'onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan' 檢查的半徑範圍（格）。<br><br><span><strong>newHatchlingIsBaby</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，新孵化的雞將為小雞（幼體）。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>（範例中已將消失計時器設為 1 秒）</em></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/despawning-eggs-hatch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>反映。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
